@startuml States - Game Session
title State Machine: Game Session
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #888888
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  StartColor #4CAF50
  EndColor #4CAF50
}

[*] --> LOBBY : POST /api/sessions\n(host creates the session)

LOBBY --> PLAYING : host sends "start"\nvia WebSocket

LOBBY --> [*] : host deletes\nthe session

PLAYING --> ROUND_END : all found\nOR timer expired

ROUND_END --> PLAYING : next track\n(4s delay)

ROUND_END --> FINISHED : last track\nfinished

FINISHED --> [*] : session archived\nin GameHistory

note right of LOBBY
  Players can join
  (code or friend invite)
end note

note right of PLAYING
  A round is active.
  Timer managed server-side.
end note

note right of FINISHED
  Final results broadcast.
  Scores persisted to DB.
end note

@enduml

@startuml States - Round
title State Machine: Round (current track)
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #888888
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
}

[*] --> LOADING : server sends\nROUND_START\n{ audioUrl, startAt }

LOADING --> PLAYING : startAt reached\n(client-side)

PLAYING --> REVEALED : Mode 1: 1st correct player\nMode 2: all correct\nOR timer expired

REVEALED --> [*] : 4s delay\nthen next round\nor end of game

note right of LOADING
  Clients load the audio.
  The server schedules
  the server timer at startAt.
end note

note right of PLAYING
  Answers are
  accepted and evaluated
  server-side only.
end note

@enduml

@startuml States - Music Import
title State Machine: Music Import (yt-dlp)
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #888888
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
}

[*] --> QUEUED : POST /admin/tracks/import\n(admin submits URL)

QUEUED --> DOWNLOADING : yt-dlp starts

DOWNLOADING --> PROCESSING : audio downloaded\nFFmpeg converts to MP3

DOWNLOADING --> FAILED : network error\nor invalid link

PROCESSING --> DONE : audio file ready\npreview available

PROCESSING --> FAILED : FFmpeg error\nor unsupported format

DONE --> PUBLISHED : admin validates\n(POST /validate)

DONE --> REJECTED : admin rejects\n(POST /reject)

FAILED --> [*] : job archived\nwith errorMessage

PUBLISHED --> [*] : track available\nin the catalogue

REJECTED --> [*] : audio file\ndeleted from server

note right of DOWNLOADING
  Progress 0-50%
  notified via WebSocket
  /user/queue/import/{jobId}
end note

note right of PROCESSING
  Progress 50-100%
  notified via WebSocket
end note

note right of DONE
  Admin listens to preview
  in the game interface
  before validating.
end note

@enduml

@startuml States - Friend Request
title State Machine: Friend Request
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #888888
  BackgroundColor #FCE4EC
}

[*] --> PENDING : Player A sends\na request\n(POST /users/{id}/friend-request)

PENDING --> ACCEPTED : Player B accepts\n(POST /requests/{id}/accept)

PENDING --> DECLINED : Player B declines\n(POST /requests/{id}/decline)

PENDING --> [*] : Player A cancels\n(DELETE /requests/{id})

ACCEPTED --> [*] : Either player\nremoves friend\n(DELETE /friends/{id})

DECLINED --> [*] : Request archived

note right of PENDING
  WebSocket notification
  sent to Player B:
  FRIEND_REQUEST { fromUser }
end note

note right of ACCEPTED
  WebSocket notification
  sent to Player A:
  FRIEND_REQUEST_ACCEPTED
end note

@enduml
